{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼♪／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝、積もった雪を眺めながら\n春のメロディーを聴いて\n健気に春はまだかなと\n考えていたまりっかです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間親戚の方からお年玉として\nヘッドホンもらいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"htcjについてるイヤホンと\n同じブランド！\nこのピンクかわいい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は時間があったので\n質問できるだけ多く答えました。\n長文注意！\n**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お茶漬けに必ず入れるもの\nってありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ううううめめめめめめ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"理想の男性像は？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男子の好きな髪型と服装は？(^-^)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近この質問多いんだあ。\nなんでだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒にいて楽しいって思える人かな。\n私、落ち着きがないから\n落ち着いてる人とか...笑\n話聞いてくれる人とか...\nでも好きになった人がタイプです！\n結局そうなる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪も服もきめすぎてないのが\n良いです。ナチュラル好きです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はまってる(集めてる)\nものある？\n前はブローチって聞いたけど。\nやっぱりブローチかな？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作ったり描いたりすることかな。\nいろんなアーティストさんの作品\n見たり買ったり、自分で作るために\nかわいい材料買ったり...\nだいぶ前に載せたのは\nハンズビーで買ったもの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハンドメイドってぬくもりがあるし、\nひとつひとつ違うから素敵。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブローチもデザイン考え中なの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"料理頑張ってるけど、\nどんな料理作りたいの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家庭的なおかず笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サルエルパンツ履く男ってどーよ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サルエルパンツって形によっては\n着こなしが難しいのあるよね。\n好きです！\n私もものすごい股下ながーい\nサルエル持ってるから\n個握で着てみようかな笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しまくるときどうしますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張しまくってると\nどうにもならないな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...深呼吸する！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなぼくですがまりかを\n応援してるという気持ち\n伝わってるかなあ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伝わってるよ^^\n応援ありがとう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この絵は、どんなイメージで\n描いたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコルさんと絵を書く時は何を\n話してこれに決めたの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコルさんとは個人の時PVから\n会ったー⁇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元から薄ーく乃木坂の三角形が\n描いてあったんだ。\nテンパっててテーマも何も\n好きなように描いてました笑\nニコルさん(ミキクラークさん)\n会ってないよー！\nめっちゃかわいくって優しかったの; ;\nまた一緒にお仕事できたら良いな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかが好きすぎて辛いです\nどうしたらいいですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしようか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなり照れます。\nありがとう嬉しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"野球自体には興味ありますか？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"球技こわいんだよー><\nキャッチボールはできるように\nなりたい笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スポーツしてる男子は\nカッコいいとおもいますか?(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃもう！！\nスポーツしてる姿がかっこいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お風呂はいつも長風呂派ですか？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族に長い！って怒られるー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギターベースドラム\nこの中で一番すきなの教えてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え！じゃあ、ベース！\n家にお父さんのベース\nあるんだよね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←これはエアギター"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...どうでもいいか笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中華料理好きかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青椒肉絲！ゴマ団子！\n中華料理ふぅっふ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春物の洋服(アイテム)で\n気になるもの有るー?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近雑誌読んでないから\n何が流行るのかわからないけど...\n襟がおもしろいシャツとか\nブラウス着たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苦手克服のときの\n「近くでテレホン」が\n頭から離れなくて、\n「春のメロディー」の歌詞が\n全然覚えられません(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは完全にまりっか中毒に\nかかってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも病院に行かないでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーはらんど？しー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近メンバーがディズニーに\nよく行ってるけど行かないの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どっちも行きたい！\n私も行きたいけど学校だ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかちゃんブログに\nダメ出ししてるの？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前おしゃべりしたときかな。\nれいかおもしろいー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪\nでもあのブログじゃなかったら\nれいかじゃないぜ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかはいじりたくなる可愛さを\n持ってますが、そのように思わせる\n何かがあるのですか？？笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだ！こっちが聞きたい！\nまりっかは悪いことしてない！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会に通信制はありますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に来てくださる方だけ\nじゃないですよ。\nコメントありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通信制って表現おもしろい！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪きれいだけどにオイルとか\nつけてる⁇"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付けてないよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポッチャリ体型の人はどうですか？\n好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいじゃないですか♪\n体型は関係ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト9\nポーチの中身見せて！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日によってポーチは変えてるよ♪\nこれは全部！\n手前のティッシュケースと\n後ろの大きいポーチは\nお母さんが作ってくれた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑よく入れてるもの\n小さいボトルはアンティークのもの。\n香水を入れてるよ！\nハートじゃないコンチョのヘアゴムは\n個人pvで使って、いただいたもの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子のポーチはにぎやかだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/17/3155668/0017.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}